Exports tinta_merman_svg_to_png: rasterize a finished SVG with the PNG
operation's renderer and fonts. Tinta lifts math labels into merman's
resvg-safe SVG (merman_engine.cpp); the PNG operation, which renders
from the Mermaid source, would draw their raw $$...$$ instead.

